## Who is responsible

Anna Avdalyan (see [Imprint](/imprint)).

## Hosting

This website is hosted by Vercel Inc. When you visit it, technically necessary data such as your IP address and browser type is processed in server logs to deliver the site securely. The website sets no tracking or advertising cookies.

## Contact form

If you send a message, your name, email address, subject and message are used only to answer you. They are delivered by email through the service Resend and are not passed on to third parties. Legal basis: your consent (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR), which you can withdraw at any time.

## Videos and recordings

Videos are embedded in YouTube's privacy-enhanced mode and recordings from Spotify or SoundCloud only load after you click play. Only then does your browser connect to these services.

## Your rights

You have the right to access, correct and delete your data, and to complain to a data protection authority.
